    "collapsible_content_kdacf9": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "pdp_faq_row_1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will it stop my dog pulling on the first walk?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Most dogs pull noticeably less on the first walk because pulling stops getting them anywhere. Some determined dogs take a few walks. That's why you get 60 days, not 60 minutes.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "pdp_faq_row_2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is this a replacement for training?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>No. It's a control tool that removes the leverage while you teach loose-lead walking. We send you \"The First 10 Walks\" so the two work together.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "pdp_faq_row_3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does it twist to the side?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Twisting almost always means the harness is a size too big or the two sides aren't tightened evenly. Fit by chest, adjust both sides, two fingers under each strap. Deep-chested dogs: see the <a href=\"/pages/fitting-guide\">fitting guide</a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "pdp_faq_row_4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "My staffy is all chest. Will it fit?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, pick by chest measurement and tighten the belly strap fully. If it doesn't sit right, swap sizes for free.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "pdp_faq_row_5": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do returns work?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Email us within 60 days. We send a prepaid Australia Post label, you drop it at any post office, we refund the full amount once it's scanned in. Size swaps are free.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "pdp_faq_row_6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Delivery times?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We ship within one business day. Australia Post standard: 2–4 business days metro, 3–6 regional, longer for remote WA/NT. Express (A$9.95): 1–3 business days.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
